# ── Maps generated at runtime ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# *.pcd/*.pgm are now tracked (2026-09-11): the actual course map artifacts
# (refined_map.pcd, course_traced_smooth.pgm, etc.) are small, load-bearing
# files the whole team needs, not disposable local scratch output. Kept the
# static_map.yaml placeholder note below for history even though it's now
# redundant with tracking *.pgm directly.
!src/challenge_bringup/maps/static_map.yaml
frames_*.gv
frames_*.pdf
